[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0010","text":"哦哦，不错嘛！\n不枉我安排了这么有圣诞节感觉的工作……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0020","text":"啊哈，有圣诞节感觉的工作呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0030","text":"……不过，这裙子真的好漂亮──！\n怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0040","text":"非常合身\n……感觉像公主一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0050","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0060","text":"刚才那句……再说一遍？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0070","text":"诶，那个……\n……像、像公主一样，这句……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0080","text":"啊哈，因为害羞了\n所以刚才那句不算──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0090","text":"……饶、饶了我吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0100","text":"不行，再说一遍\n好好说给我听？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32700100_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
